{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Window Aquarista is a chill idle game about building and keeping your own aquariums. All while focusing on other tasks as the game sits on the bottom of your screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerRaiseEm.png?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/WAnormalGif0.gif?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hatch fish from eggs.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fish will lay eggs that will hatch after a certain time. Be patient with them!\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your fish grow while you do other things.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatching them is only the beginning of their journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock over 60 different types of fish!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new fish while afk!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell your fish to build your fortune.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hatch them, raise them, sell them, repeat. OR Sell your surplus fish to fill your chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerFeedEm.png?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/WAfeedingGif1.gif?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep your fish fed to keep them happy!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed your fish from time to time or they will go lethargic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Try different foods for different effects!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spice up their diet to break the monotony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerCleanEm.png?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/WAcleaningGif0.gif?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep it clean!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Algae may take over an unwatched tank, but you have the tools to restore it to its full glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerDecorateEm.png?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/WAdecoGif0.gif?t=1749570943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take a look at the ever growing catalogue of decorations and create your dream aquarium.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thematic tanks? Feeling original? The options are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerMulti-task.png?t=1749570943\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game sits at the bottom of your screen, in a non-intrusive manner.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work, watch, play, or do whatever you want while your fish live in the bottom of your screen!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multi task without interferences.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something requires your full attention? No problem, quickly set the game out of view, while still running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/WAminimizingGif0.gif?t=1749570943\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802850?t=1749570943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802850?t=1749570943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/ab5dbbbd918492df0ac38e320ad8d9ca8005d37d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749570943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/ab5dbbbd918492df0ac38e320ad8d9ca8005d37d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749570943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Window Aquarista is a chill idle game about building and keeping your own aquariums. All while focusing on other tasks as the game sits on the bottom of your screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/BannerRaiseEm.png?t=1749570943\"